# ==============================================================================
# HAND — .gitignore
#
# Tracked: the library (hand/, hand_v2/), the entry points (tools/), the release
# payload and its notices (release/), the evidence behind the published numbers
# (experiments/, results_real/, results_recovery/, dataset_audit.json), the paper
# and the documentation (docs/). The paper is not part of this repository.
#
# Not tracked, and never to be: datasets, model weights, training runs, logs, and
# anything carrying a credential or an absolute machine path.
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Datasets — obtain from the original sources; see data/README.md
#
# No corpus is redistributed. data/ holds only symlinks created by
# scripts/setup_dataset_links.sh; they point at machine-local paths and are
# meaningless in a clone. A directory rule cannot be undone by a file exception,
# so the CONTENTS are excluded and the README is re-included.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
/data/*
!/data/README.md
/formatted/
/raw_READ2016/
/IAM/
/KHATT/
/AHAWP_extracted/
/weights/
*.lmdb
*.mdb

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Fonts — reproduce byte-exactly with scripts/setup_dan_fonts.sh; the binaries
# themselves stay out of git. The two machine-checkable statements about the 41
# audited files ARE tracked.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
/fonts_dan_read/*
!/fonts_dan_read/VERIFICATION.json
!/fonts_dan_read/CHECKSUMS.sha256
/Fonts/
*.ttf
*.otf

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Model weights and training runs. `git` is not a model registry.
#
# Leading slashes matter: an unanchored `models/` would also match `hand/models/`,
# the model package itself. Anchor anything meant for one top-level directory.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
/models/*
!/models/README.md
/outputs/
checkpoints/
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.pkl

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Results: measured metrics are tracked evidence; logs and prediction dumps are not.
#
# Bulk per-sample prediction dumps are NEVER tracked. They contain ground-truth
# transcriptions of IAM and KHATT, both licensed for research use under
# registration and not redistributable. Excluded by rule, not by the accident of a
# dump currently being empty. The few IAM/KHATT samples reproduced inside the
# paper's qualitative figures are the only exception; the per-row JSON those
# figure scripts write beside the figures is excluded as well.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
predictions.json
results_recovery/**/predictions.json
/experiments/qualitative/iam/*.json
/experiments/qualitative/khatt/prediction_test_*.json
*.log
*.out
slurm-*.out

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated tables — regenerate with tools/make_tables.py
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
/paper_tables/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The manuscript is not distributed with the code; keep any local copy out of git.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
/paper/
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Experiment trackers and run scratch
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
wandb/
mlruns/
lightning_logs/
/runs/
.cache/
*.tfevents.*
events.out.tfevents.*

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
*.egg
build/
dist/
.eggs/
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environments
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Tooling, editors, OS
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Credentials — never commit any of this
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
id_rsa*
.netrc
